---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SignalPath from '../components/SignalPath.astro';
import { SRC, CHECKED, BENCH } from '../data/normacore';
const maxAim = BENCH.aim[0];
---
<Base title="Off the Bench">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="kicker">An unofficial, hands-on guide to NormaCore</p>
      <h1>NormaCore moves robots and records every reading. Here is how it works, and how to try it.</h1>
      <p class="lede">NormaCore is an open source stack for physical AI: a 3D-printed arm, a single-binary runtime called Station, and a data pipeline that ends in a trained policy. This site explains the stack in plain terms, runs a simulated ElRobot you can program in your browser, and documents Station with commands we ran ourselves.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/playground">Open the playground</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-fig card"><SignalPath /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="bench">
    <header class="sh">
      <p class="eyebrow">From the bench</p>
      <h2 id="bench">What we measured on real arms</h2>
      <p>On 22 November 2026, at HackLab 2 in Berlin, we ran an ElRobot and an SO-101 on one Station with Claude Code in charge. These are our numbers, not NormaCore's.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="claims">
      <article class="card claim">
        <span class="hw">Ran on real hardware, 22 Nov</span>
        <h3>Aim miss on one hole, three runs</h3>
        <div class="bars" role="img" aria-label="Aim miss fell from 24.3 millimeters to about 5.6, then to about 2 to 3 millimeters">
          {BENCH.aim.map((v, i) => (
            <div class="bar"><span class="bl">Run {i + 1}</span><span class="track"><i style={`width:${(v / maxAim) * 100}%;background:${i ? 'var(--pop-mint)' : 'var(--pop-peach)'}`}></i></span><b>{i === 2 ? '2 to 3 mm' : `${v} mm`}</b></div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p>We measured each miss on the camera picture and corrected the aim for the next round. The last value is a visual estimate.</p>
        <p class="srcs">Source: <a href="/lab">our lab results</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card claim">
        <span class="hw">Ran on real hardware, 22 Nov</span>
        <h3>Arm sag under gravity</h3>
        <p class="big">{BENCH.heightBefore} → &lt;{BENCH.heightAfter} <span>mm height error</span></p>
        <p>Gravity pulled the arm down, so the tool landed up to {BENCH.heightBefore} mm off in height. A closed-loop correction brought it under {BENCH.heightAfter} mm.</p>
        <p class="srcs">Source: <a href="/lab">our lab results</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card claim">
        <span class="hw">Ran on real hardware, 22 Nov</span>
        <h3>One cell, two arms</h3>
        <ul class="kv">
          <li><b>{BENCH.tools}</b> MCP tools for Claude Code</li>
          <li><b>{BENCH.guardsFired}</b> of {BENCH.guardsTotal} guards fired for real</li>
          <li><b>2</b> arms on one Station</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Every move went through a guard layer, and a human approved every motion call. The playground runs a copy of the guards.</p>
        <p class="srcs">Source: <a href="/lab">our lab results</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <figure class="trailer card">
      <video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/media/floor-truth-poster.jpg" src="/media/floor-truth-trailer.mp4" aria-label="44 second trailer of the Floor Truth robot cell"></video>
      <figcaption>The Floor Truth cell in 44 seconds. The full video is on the <a href="/lab">lab page</a>.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="try">
    <header class="sh">
      <p class="eyebrow">No robot needed</p>
      <h2 id="try">Four ways to start today</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="tries">
      <a class="try pop pop-sky" href="/stack">
        <span class="tn">Understand it</span>
        <h3>How it fits together</h3>
        <p>The six layers of the stack, how data flows through Station as streams, and a dated release timeline.</p>
        <span class="go">See the stack →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="try pop pop-lilac" href="/playground">
        <span class="tn">In your browser</span>
        <h3>Playground</h3>
        <p>Program a simulated ElRobot in Python, watch it move, then push it too far and see the guard refuse.</p>
        <span class="go">Open the playground →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="try pop pop-butter" href="/docs/quickstart">
        <span class="tn">On your machine</span>
        <h3>Your first hour</h3>
        <p>Download Station, start it with no hardware, open the web UI and read your first stream. Every step tested.</p>
        <span class="go">Start the quickstart →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="try pop pop-mint" href="/lab">
        <span class="tn">From the bench</span>
        <h3>Lab results</h3>
        <p>Charts, raw CSVs and the full video from two arms on one Station, run by Claude Code.</p>
        <span class="go">See the results →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="forumcta pop pop-peach">
      <div><h3>Stuck on something?</h3><p>NormaCore's own Discord is where the team and other builders answer questions.</p></div>
      <a class="btn dark" href="https://discord.com/invite/Z4Ytw3QfHP" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Join their Discord</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="checked">Facts checked against NormaCore sources on {CHECKED}. This is an independent guide, not NormaCore material.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero{max-width:var(--wide);margin:0 auto;padding:56px 0 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;}
  .hero-copy{max-width:860px;}
  .kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet);font-weight:600;margin-top:14px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,60px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.06;}
  .lede{font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,19.5px);color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:18px;max-width:58ch;}
  .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px;}
  .hero-fig{padding:18px;background:var(--surface);}
  @media (max-width:940px){ .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:36px;} }

  .band{max-width:var(--wide);margin:0 auto;padding:56px 0 8px;}
  .sh{max-width:720px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600;}
  .sh h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,38px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-top:6px;}
  .sh p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:10px;font-size:17.5px;}

  .stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;}
  @media (max-width:1040px){ .stack{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .stack{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .layer{border-radius:var(--r);padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;color:#2B2638;}
  .lhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;}
  .num{background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 8px;}
  .layer h3{font-size:19px;line-height:1.2;}
  .layer > p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;}
  .layer dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:4px 10px;margin:4px 0 0;font-size:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;}
  .layer dt{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;opacity:.75;padding-top:2px;}
  .layer dd{margin:0;font-weight:600;}
  .srcs{font-size:12.5px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin-top:auto;}
  .srcs a{color:inherit;}
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .layer,:root[data-theme="dark"] .pop{color:#1B1824;}

  .how{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px;align-items:start;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .how{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .how-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:17px;max-width:64ch;}
  .callout{background:var(--violet-f);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px 18px;border-left:4px solid var(--violet);}
  .callout .ctitle{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .callout p{font-size:16px;}
  .ops{padding:20px 22px;}
  .ops h3{font-size:19px;}
  .opsub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);margin:16px 0 8px;font-weight:600;}
  .chips{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;}
  .chip{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:99px;color:#2B2638;}
  .c-lilac{background:var(--pop-lilac);} .c-sky{background:var(--pop-sky);}
  .c-butter{background:var(--pop-butter);}
  .opnote{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:14px;}
  .ops .srcs{color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:16px;}
  .ops .srcs a{color:var(--ink-2);}

  .claims{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;}
  @media (max-width:940px){ .claims{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .claim{padding:20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
  .claim h3{font-size:18px;}
  .claim p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);}
  .claim .srcs{color:var(--ink-3);}
  .claim .srcs a{color:var(--ink-2);}
  .bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  .bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px minmax(0,1fr) 64px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;}
  .bl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-2);}
  .track{height:16px;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;}
  .track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;min-width:6px;}
  .bar b{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .big{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:26px !important;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink) !important;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  .big span{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-3);}
  .kv{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:15.5px;}
  .kv b{font-family:var(--disp);font-size:20px;color:var(--violet);margin-right:6px;}

  .timeline{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:10px;}
  .timeline li{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px 16px;border-top:4px solid var(--pop-sky);}
  .timeline li:nth-child(3n+2){border-top-color:var(--pop-lilac);} .timeline li:nth-child(3n){border-top-color:var(--pop-mint);}
  .when{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);}
  .timeline p{font-size:15px;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;}
  .timeline a{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);}

  .tries{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;}
  @media (max-width:1040px){ .tries{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));} }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .tries{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .try{text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;transition:transform .25s var(--ease),box-shadow .25s var(--ease);}
  .try:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--sh-lg);}
  .tn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;opacity:.75;}
  .try h3{font-size:22px;}
  .try p{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.5;}
  .go{font-weight:700;margin-top:auto;padding-top:6px;}

  .forumcta{margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .forumcta h3{font-size:21px;}
  .forumcta p{font-size:15.5px;margin-top:2px;}
  .btn.dark{background:#2B2638;color:#FBF6EA;}
  .hw{align-self:flex-start;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;color:var(--mint);background:var(--mint-f);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 9px;}
  .bar{grid-template-columns:52px minmax(0,1fr) 78px !important;}
  .trailer{margin:14px auto 0;padding:12px;max-width:880px;}
  .trailer video{width:100%;border-radius:var(--r-sm);display:block;background:#000;aspect-ratio:16/9;}
  .trailer figcaption{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:8px;}
  .checked{max-width:var(--wide);margin:40px auto 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-3);}
</style>
